<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.sc_software_tools.sc_utility_suite_dist.ArchiveUnpacker</id>
  <name>Archive Unpacker</name>
  <summary>Open and extract ZIP, RAR and 7z archives, and create ZIP files</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>LicenseRef-proprietary</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.sc_software_tools"><name>SC Software</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>Open and extract ZIP, RAR (RAR4 and RAR5), 7z, TAR, GZ and BZ2 archives, and create ZIP files.</p>
    <p>Look inside an archive before extracting, pick just the files you need, and open password-protected archives. Archives that try to write outside their folder are blocked.</p>
    <p>Free to use; a one-time PRO licence (Gumroad) unlocks batch and advanced features. Files are processed locally.</p>
  </description>
